Exact schema: W:python/owl/kaggriculture/types.py:109–138,174. `banks[e,s,:]` is self/rival; transition banks are absolute seats 0/1. Terminal-step masks/clock/banks describe the new game. Fully overwrite padding. Actor frame ordinal = actor_slot = kernel actor index (farmer, then hands); W:python/owl/model/kaggriculture.py:573; G:ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/briefs/1.2.md:585.

## Exact native signatures and Python stub

Declarations are the required signatures, not skeleton implementation bodies. Locally permit too_many_arguments as Isaiah does. Every ndarray borrow lasts the whole operation. Error mapping: admission/grammar/engine → PyValueError with env/seat/field; seed range/arithmetic → PyOverflowError; caught panic → PyRuntimeError. No partial result. Exact keyword-only signatures:

